.superpowers/
# Working specs/plans for the agentic workflow — kept local alongside
# .superpowers/ above (operator decision, 2026-08-21; the directory was also
# removed from git history at the same time).
docs/superpowers/
*.wasm
tools/yaegi-check/llmgw-yaegi-check
tools/pricing-sync/llmgw-pricing-sync
dist/

# webui/'s build output (dist/, matched above) and npm dependency tree —
# neither is source: dist/ is regenerated by `vite build`, node_modules/ by
# `npm ci`. admin_assets_gen.go (repo root, `make admin-ui`'s other output)
# is the only artifact from webui/ that is actually committed.
webui/node_modules/

# Rendered from integration/traefik/dynamic.yml.tmpl by `make integration-up`
# (INTEGRATION_REAL_BASEURL substitution) — generated, not source. A whole
# directory (not a single file): Traefik's directory-based file provider
# watches integration/traefik/dynamic/, matching the k8s-ConfigMap-mount
# pattern (see traefik.yml's own comment).
integration/traefik/dynamic/
# Stale-checkout hygiene: this used to be the single rendered file, before
# the switch to the directory above. Keeping it ignored means a leftover
# copy from an older checkout (or a stash/worktree predating the switch)
# never gets accidentally `git add`-ed back in.
integration/traefik/dynamic.yml
